<title>ROMANIA: TENNIS-ROMANIA OPEN QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-ROMANIA OPEN QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter-final results in the</p>
<p>Romanian Open men's tennis tournament on Friday (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Christian Ruud (Norway) beat Dinu Pescariu (Romania) 6-2 7-5</p>
<p>3-Carlos Moya (Spain) beat 5-Francisco Clavet (Spain) 6-2 6-3</p>
<p>Andrei Pavel (Romania) beat 8-Jiri Novak (Czech Republic) 6-3</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>4-Alberto Berasategui (Spain) beat Ion Moldovan (Romania) 6-4 6-2.</p>
<p>Saturday's semifinals: Ruud v Berasategui, Moya v Pavel.</p>
</text>
